PRE_EXISTING_FLAGGED: 2
TESTS_RUN: YES
TESTS_PASSING: YES
FILES_MODIFIED: 3
EXIT_SIGNAL: true
SUMMARY: Fixed 6 issues, skipped 1 disputed item, all tests pass
---END_SYNTHESIS_STATUS---
```

## Example: No Issues Found
```
---SYNTHESIS_STATUS---
HIGH_CONFIDENCE_FIXES: 0
MEDIUM_CONFIDENCE_FIXES: 0
